  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yaml at 21.14.5 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* 🎨 style(test): mark prompt fixture locals Final by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3374\n* 🎨 style: give every Final annotation its type by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3375\n* 🐛 fix(ci): dump stacks from a thread that holds the GIL by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3377\n* Reset the embed update log when it cannot be read by @pasmud in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3376\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.14.4...21.14.5",
